1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,682
Can a model recognize classes it's never trained on?

2
00:00:03,982 --> 00:00:07,702
DeViSE learns word embeddings and visual features.

3
00:00:08,052 --> 00:00:13,284
Then it maps images into a shared space, so the correct labels score higher.

4
00:00:13,684 --> 00:00:18,604
It can even predict unseen classes, if their word embeddings are available.
